he dangers and losses that come with this connection as she tries to learn who she is, with action sequences, investigation and quiet character moments all playing a part.\n\nThe cast is led by Willem Dafoe and Elliot Page. The choices and actions you take influence where Jodie's story goes. Co-op allows a second player to take control of Aiden alongside the first, though the game is fully playable alone. It suits players who value cinematic, character-led storytelling over mechanical complexity."}}